aoeqol.config.betterfps=BetterFPS
aoeqol.config.betterfps.tooltip=BetterFPS: creative inventory search.
aoeqol.config.preventAsyncCreativeSearch=Prevent async creative search
aoeqol.config.preventAsyncCreativeSearch.tooltip=BetterFPS's "Async" creative search can crash the game. On: use BetterFPS's normal fast search instead. Off: keep Async. Applies the next time the creative inventory opens.
aoeqol.config.rftools=RFTools
aoeqol.config.rftools.tooltip=RFTools: Storage Scanner.
aoeqol.config.syncStorageScannerWithJei=Sync Storage Scanner search with JEI
aoeqol.config.syncStorageScannerWithJei.tooltip=Typing in the Storage Scanner's search box fills in JEI's, and the other way round, like AE2's "JEI synchronized" search.
aoeqol.config.ic2=IndustrialCraft 2
aoeqol.config.ic2.tooltip=IndustrialCraft 2.
aoeqol.config.splitterCableConnectsRedstone=EU-Splitter Cable connects to redstone
aoeqol.config.splitterCableConnectsRedstone.tooltip=Redstone dust and Ender IO redstone conduits connect to the EU-Splitter Cable by themselves (no Yeta Wrench needed). Existing dust and conduits update when a block next to them changes.
aoeqol.config.minecraft=Minecraft
aoeqol.config.minecraft.tooltip=Minecraft itself.
aoeqol.config.ignoreLeftoverMouseJump=Ignore leftover mouse jump
aoeqol.config.ignoreLeftoverMouseJump.tooltip=Now and then, closing a screen spins your view, because the cursor's distance from the middle of the window is read as one big mouse movement. On: that one leftover reading is ignored; real mouse movement is unchanged. Off: Minecraft's normal behaviour.
aoeqol.config.jec=Just Enough Calculation
aoeqol.config.jec.tooltip=Just Enough Calculation.
aoeqol.config.ignoreConditionTags=Recipes chain for items in any condition
aoeqol.config.ignoreConditionTags.tooltip=Items that only differ in condition (heat, charge, wear) count as the same item, so recipes using them chain (IC2 reactor parts, batteries, crystals). Which tags count is set in JEC's own config. Off: JEC's normal exact matching.
aoeqol.config.oreDictUnification=Ore dictionary unification
aoeqol.config.oreDictUnification.tooltip=Choosing an ore dictionary preference rewrites your saved recipes to use it, recipes saved later are unified automatically, and /jecunify applies all preferences. Off: saved recipes are never changed.
aoeqol.config.smarterIngredientMatching=Smarter ingredient matching
aoeqol.config.smarterIngredientMatching.tooltip=Crafting grid and Crafter: charged batteries and worn tools are recognised, the exact variant is taken first, other mods' ore dictionary equivalents come next, and a wrong variant is marked red. Off: RFTools' normal matching.
aoeqol.config.fixSplitNetworks=Keep split cable networks powered
aoeqol.config.fixSplitNetworks.tooltip=When a cable network is split (cable broken, splitter switching off, part of it unloading), the new pieces get their routes right away. Off: IC2's normal behaviour, where a split-off piece can stay unpowered until something is placed in it or the world reloads.
aoeqol.config.fixQuitFreeze=Fix freeze on Save and Quit
aoeqol.config.fixQuitFreeze.tooltip="Save and Quit to Title" can freeze for good, more often after opening to LAN. On: once the built-in server has stopped, the game stops waiting for it. Off: Minecraft's normal behaviour.
